			"Message": "refactor(Project): Reduce logging noise across Mountain and Output\n\nSubmodule sync bringing continued log volume optimization:\n\n1. **Mountain (refactor):** Move high-frequency logging to verbose/opt-in tags. Command registration moves from `commands` → `commands-verbose` (~130/session), output channels from `grpc` → `output-verbose` (200+ appends), command registry from `grpc` → `command-register` (~100/session), provider registration to `grpc-verbose`/`provider-register`, extension scanning to `ext-scan-verbose` (203 candidates), and scheme assets to `scheme-assets`. All new tags added to SHORT_MODE_MUTED_TAGS.\n\n2. **Output (fix):** Suppress benign ENOENT errors in Tauri invoke logging. Extensions probe for optional workspace files (`.vscode/settings.json`, `.vscode/tasks.json`) that don't exist on fresh installs, each triggering log spam. Detect benign ENOENT patterns for `file:stat` and `file:readFile` and filter them.\n\n3. **Cocoon (sync):** Submodule update to latest commit.\n\nImpact: Default log volume reduced further while preserving error visibility and diagnostic capability.",
			"SHA": "786efde99dc3922147183375645841751ecd3fc2"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
