				"⡇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				3
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Add land-native search provider and expose ISearchService\n\nCross-cutting search integration across Sky, Output, and Mountain:\n\n- **Sky (b4358aa9):** Add search result provider routing VS Code's Search viewlet queries through Mountain's `search:findFiles` / `search:findInFiles` handlers. The stock web's `RemoteSearchService` relies on File System Access API which returns `undefined` for Mountain-based filesystem, causing silent zero-result returns. New provider registers for both `file` (0) and `text` (1) search types, translating Mountain hits into `IFileMatch` shape. Also add global exception cap to PostHogBridge to prevent CDN limit flooding (configurable via `LAND_POSTHOG_SKY_EXCEPTION_GLOBAL_LIMIT`, defaults to 7).\n\n- **Output (f651b48f):** Extend ExposeWorkbenchAccessor ESBuild transform to expose ISearchService alongside existing Statusbar, Commands, and CommandRegistry services. Adds require for `vs/workbench/services/search/common/search` and includes `Search` entry in `__CEL_SERVICES__` global, enabling Sky-side bridge code to access search service without re-entering AMD loader.\n\n- **Cocoon (5bc55a9f):** Submodule sync.\n\nImpact: Search functionality now works in the Land editor with Mountain-based filesystem. PostHog exception telemetry respects CDN rate limits.",
			"SHA": "b0c61117bc38976c071b8690baa6017a75eec5c4"
		}
